{
  "title": "Aromatic Jamaican Goat Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and flavorful stew featuring tender goat meat and aromatic spices, cooked to perfection in a clay pot tagliere. This dish is perfect for a midnight craving.",
  "cuisine": "Jamaican",
